Subject: [PATCH] presentation: stabilize navigation within each touch gesture
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

与 Mihon 0050 同源：一次触摸只切换一次导航，6dp意图容差，225ms恢复和速度感知收起；统一内容留白并让快速滑块避开悬浮导航。正文视口保持稳定。
